### Criar um post (autenticado, só AUTHOR)
# @name createPost
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Não publicado 2",
  "content": "Conteúdo de teste criado via REST Client.",
  "published": false
}

### Atualizar um post (autor dono do post)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/posts/2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "title": "Título editado",
  "content": "Conteúdo editado."
}

### Publicar/despublicar um post (PATCH parcial)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/posts/6/publish
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "published": true
}

### Deletar um post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/3
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### =========================================================
### COMMENTS
### =========================================================

### Listar comentários de um post
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/6/comments

### Buscar um comentário específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/posts/1/comments/1

### Criar um comentário (autenticado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/6/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "content": "Comentário de teste."
}

### Editar um comentário (autor do comentário)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
  "content": "Comentário editado."
}

### Deletar um comentário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### =========================================================
### LIKES
### =========================================================

### Dar like em um post
POST {{baseUrl}}/posts/4/like
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Remover like de um post
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/posts/4/like
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Dar like em um comentário
POST {{baseUrl}}/comments/2/like
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Remover like de um comentário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/comments/2/like
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}